Description: destination-neutral infrastructure discovery worker and CLI
 Topo discovers infrastructure through compiled-in, locally approved operations
 and emits destination-neutral observations. Its outbound worker supports
 ServiceNow-managed Linux SSH and restricted Windows HTTPS computer/interface
 inventory. Administrator preparation, credentials and verified trust files
 are required before discovery. Installation does not enable or start services.
